WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:27.760 --> 00:28.510
Senior,

3
00:29.360 --> 00:30.790
could this coffin

4
00:33.120 --> 00:35.520
have been deliberately left for us by Hong?

5
00:36.430 --> 00:37.750
She knew the people from the Tianxiang Sect

6
00:37.750 --> 00:39.480
would find her sooner or later,

7
00:39.920 --> 00:41.280
so she spread false news

8
00:41.280 --> 00:42.750
that the child was dead

9
00:43.350 --> 00:44.810
and even made a fake grave.

10
00:45.070 --> 00:46.330
The whole point was...

11
00:48.240 --> 00:51.100
to make sure no one could find Shangguan Chengming.

12
00:53.070 --> 00:54.640
People in our line of work

13
00:54.880 --> 00:56.210
rarely have offspring.

14
00:56.880 --> 00:59.140
Whether it's karma or just coincidence,

15
00:59.200 --> 01:00.470
who can tell?

16
01:00.670 --> 01:03.400
You've never gotten over what the old Sect Master

17
01:03.600 --> 01:05.310
said to you back then.

18
01:06.200 --> 01:08.200
He said you'd never have offspring.

19
01:08.310 --> 01:10.480
But now you have a son.

20
01:11.070 --> 01:12.230
I...

21
01:13.650 --> 01:15.010
am honestly envious.

22
01:17.560 --> 01:18.280
Is that so?

23
01:19.400 --> 01:20.000
Senior,

24
01:20.480 --> 01:21.789
if I were you,

25
01:22.390 --> 01:24.120
even if he weren't really mine,

26
01:27.580 --> 01:29.530
I'd still raise him as my own.

27
01:29.920 --> 01:32.520
Do you really think he's worthy of being my son?

28
03:18.540 --> 03:22.590
[A Prophet]

29
03:23.160 --> 03:25.560
[Episode 22]

30
03:29.120 --> 03:30.380
Shangguan Chengming,

31
03:30.590 --> 03:32.240
I must congratulate you.

32
03:32.280 --> 03:34.910
You ran this scam beautifully.

33
03:35.280 --> 03:36.470
Others set the trap,

34
03:38.400 --> 03:39.800
and you reap the rewards.

35
03:40.960 --> 03:41.890
Second Brother,

36
03:42.170 --> 03:43.970
are you talking about his career

37
03:44.450 --> 03:45.640
or love life?

38
03:46.190 --> 03:47.400
Get lost.

39
03:48.400 --> 03:49.730
Still, we really owe you

40
03:50.310 --> 03:52.570
for what happened with the Zhang family.

41
03:52.710 --> 03:54.910
I must propose a toast to you.

42
03:58.520 --> 04:00.430
Feiyan, since you're toasting Second Brother,

43
04:00.430 --> 04:02.030
shouldn't you two drink a cross-cupped toast?

44
04:02.030 --> 04:02.800
What do you think, Third Brother?

45
04:02.800 --> 04:03.360
Yes.

46
04:03.520 --> 04:04.800
You two should drink a cross-cupped toast.

47
04:04.800 --> 04:06.190
No problem.

48
04:06.840 --> 04:07.590
Thank you, Second Master.

49
04:07.590 --> 04:08.450
Come on, Yanzi!

50
04:10.080 --> 04:11.840
Second Brother is blushing.

51
04:12.080 --> 04:13.120
You know nothing.

52
04:13.430 --> 04:14.430
For Fifth Batou,

53
04:14.800 --> 04:16.390
if she so much as says the word,

54
04:16.390 --> 04:17.750
I'd give my life.

55
04:18.510 --> 04:19.240
Fifth Batou.

56
04:21.000 --> 04:23.120
You guys saved Li Ling?

57
04:30.170 --> 04:32.100
This has nothing to do with others.

58
04:32.360 --> 04:33.510
I did it all on my own.

59
04:34.000 --> 04:36.630
I just couldn't stand watching you men live the good life

60
04:36.630 --> 04:37.890
while we women suffer.

61
04:45.070 --> 04:45.930
Second Master,

62
04:46.800 --> 04:48.400
Fifth Batou saved the Paozi.

63
04:48.920 --> 04:50.920
Does that count as ruining the scam?

64
04:55.040 --> 04:55.900
Sixth Brother,

65
04:56.070 --> 04:58.600
I'm a little drunk today.

66
04:58.740 --> 05:00.740
Let's forget about the rules first.

67
05:00.830 --> 05:01.720
At least

68
05:02.190 --> 05:03.190
we all made money,

69
05:03.270 --> 05:03.630
right?

70
05:03.630 --> 05:04.800
Rules are rules.

71
05:05.510 --> 05:06.440
Second Brother,

72
05:06.630 --> 05:08.090
I'll ask you one more time.

73
05:08.110 --> 05:09.560
Does Jiang Feiyan saving the Paozi

74
05:09.560 --> 05:10.240
count

75
05:10.600 --> 05:11.750
as ruining the scam?

76
05:19.030 --> 05:21.540
I could hear you shouting from far away.

77
05:22.040 --> 05:22.770
Sect Master.

78
05:22.830 --> 05:23.750
Master.

79
05:31.240 --> 05:32.100
What happened?

80
05:32.240 --> 05:34.310
Fifth Batou and Shangguan Chengming

81
05:34.630 --> 05:36.390
saved a Paozi in a scam.

82
05:36.510 --> 05:37.630
They were also the ones

83
05:37.630 --> 05:38.750
who ruined the scam.

84
05:38.750 --> 05:39.390
Well...

85
05:39.409 --> 05:40.220
It's up to you.

86
05:40.800 --> 05:42.460
What do you think we should do?

87
05:50.630 --> 05:51.490
Sixth Brother.

88
05:53.159 --> 05:54.420
Shangguan Chengming.

89
05:54.620 --> 05:56.430
According to the Tianxiang Sect's rules,

90
05:56.430 --> 05:57.159
either

91
05:58.430 --> 05:59.950
you kill Jiang Feiyan,

92
06:00.100 --> 06:00.940
or...

93
06:01.320 --> 06:02.560
I'll kill

94
06:03.720 --> 06:04.720
both of you today.

95
06:38.080 --> 06:39.640
Why should I kill her?

96
06:40.500 --> 06:42.170
I did break the rules.

97
06:43.680 --> 06:45.310
But did I stop us from making money?

98
06:45.310 --> 06:48.010
The rules are the backbone of the Tianxiang Sect.

99
06:48.010 --> 06:50.540
You ruined the scam, so you broke the rules.

100
06:50.570 --> 06:53.240
You didn't mind it when you put the money in your pocket,

101
06:53.240 --> 06:55.440
but now you're talking about the rules?

102
06:55.520 --> 06:56.640
The Sect Master

103
06:56.800 --> 06:58.540
is treating everyone to a whole roast lamb today.

104
06:58.540 --> 06:59.710
A live lamb

105
06:59.740 --> 07:01.650
costs 5 silver dollars at the market.

106
07:01.650 --> 07:02.870
Once it's cooked and served,

107
07:02.870 --> 07:04.830
it's worth 20.

108
07:05.990 --> 07:07.470
And as for the Zhang family's scam,

109
07:07.470 --> 07:08.910
the other Batous see it

110
07:08.930 --> 07:10.880
as a deal worth 50 gold bars.

111
07:11.670 --> 07:12.790
But to me,

112
07:13.240 --> 07:14.440
it's worth 500.

113
07:14.470 --> 07:15.960
What's the point?

114
07:20.550 --> 07:21.430
See?

115
07:21.960 --> 07:24.360
When there's meat, everyone's eyes are on the meat.

116
07:24.360 --> 07:25.690
Now that there's money,

117
07:25.870 --> 07:27.730
everyone's eyes are on the money.

118
07:27.850 --> 07:29.180
Now everyone in Yuzheng

119
07:29.270 --> 07:31.040
knows that soul-trapping rituals bring wealth.

120
07:31.040 --> 07:32.360
They're all asking around

121
07:32.360 --> 07:33.750
about who can perform that.

122
07:33.750 --> 07:35.480
Zhang and his son went to jail,

123
07:35.870 --> 07:36.630
but I can find you 50 more

124
07:36.630 --> 07:39.230
Zhangs and their sons just like them in no time.

125
07:39.390 --> 07:41.040
If I remember correctly,

126
07:41.159 --> 07:43.159
the first rule of the Tianxiang Sect

127
07:43.560 --> 07:45.159
is to overthrow the Qing and restore the Ming.

128
07:45.159 --> 07:47.270
The Qing Dynasty has been gone for ages.

129
07:47.270 --> 07:47.950
So what now?

130
07:48.270 --> 07:50.730
Should we disband the Tianxiang Sect today?

131
07:51.480 --> 07:53.580
The old rules have held the Tianxiang Sect back for too long.

132
07:53.580 --> 07:54.840
We only made it this far

133
07:54.920 --> 07:56.450
because the Sect Master changed the rules.

134
07:56.450 --> 07:58.510
How dare you compare yourself to the Sect Master?

135
07:58.510 --> 07:59.510
He did it for his brothers.

136
07:59.510 --> 08:00.370
What about you?

137
08:00.560 --> 08:03.120
Today, you dared to break the rules for a few gold bars.

138
08:03.120 --> 08:05.000
Tomorrow, you'll dare to tear down the Sect Master's altar!

139
08:05.000 --> 08:05.720
Fine!

140
08:06.920 --> 08:09.070
Then there's another rule in the Tianxiang Sect:

141
08:09.070 --> 08:11.000
when you run a scam, you don't kill.

142
08:11.190 --> 08:12.850
But I believe every Batou here

143
08:12.920 --> 08:14.680
has spilled plenty of blood.

144
08:15.170 --> 08:16.970
By your logic,

145
08:23.110 --> 08:25.640
shouldn't you all be killed today?

146
08:40.480 --> 08:42.870
We've got a perfectly good roast lamb here,

147
08:42.870 --> 08:44.490
and you're here talking about killing.

148
08:44.490 --> 08:45.650
We eat the meat,

149
08:46.080 --> 08:47.080
we make the money,

150
08:47.550 --> 08:49.000
and we follow the rules.

151
08:49.510 --> 08:50.320
In this scam,

152
08:50.910 --> 08:52.640
Yanzi and Shangguan Chengming

153
08:52.750 --> 08:53.790
have done both good

154
08:53.790 --> 08:54.440
and bad.

155
08:54.630 --> 08:55.510
I'll keep that

156
08:55.910 --> 08:57.200
in mind for now.

157
08:58.000 --> 08:58.790
Next,

158
08:59.200 --> 09:00.460
Shangguan Chengming.

159
09:02.190 --> 09:03.460
We'll all wait for

160
09:04.030 --> 09:07.030
those 50 Zhangs and their sons you promised.

161
09:08.450 --> 09:09.090
Alright?

162
09:10.070 --> 09:10.710
Yes.

163
09:14.130 --> 09:14.960
Let's eat.

164
09:15.390 --> 09:16.030
Yes.

165
09:16.320 --> 09:16.920
Let's eat.

166
09:17.320 --> 09:18.320
Let's make a toast

167
09:18.630 --> 09:19.360
to the Sect Master!

168
09:19.360 --> 09:20.120
Here, here.

169
09:20.120 --> 09:20.580
Master.

170
09:20.840 --> 09:21.120
Master.

171
09:21.120 --> 09:22.120
Drink up. Come on.

172
09:41.160 --> 09:42.280
You know what?

173
09:43.480 --> 09:44.940
The Sect Master is raising

174
09:45.140 --> 09:46.740
a lot of children in the sect.

175
09:47.270 --> 09:48.390
Most of them

176
09:49.260 --> 09:51.320
were Abaos' illegitimate children.

177
09:52.740 --> 09:53.800
Some were abandoned babies

178
09:53.800 --> 09:55.260
picked up off the streets.

179
09:56.280 --> 09:57.610
Others

180
09:58.470 --> 10:00.530
were bought from human traffickers.

181
10:00.680 --> 10:03.110
Why does the Sect Master raise so many children?

182
10:03.110 --> 10:04.560
You see them as children,

183
10:05.910 --> 10:06.790
but to him,

184
10:07.400 --> 10:09.200
they're tools for making money.

185
10:10.750 --> 10:12.010
The good-looking ones

186
10:12.310 --> 10:13.970
are sold to wealthy families.

187
10:14.390 --> 10:15.320
The clever ones

188
10:16.150 --> 10:18.210
stay in the Tianxiang Sect as agents.

189
10:18.390 --> 10:19.510
As for

190
10:20.480 --> 10:21.670
the disabled ones,

191
10:22.150 --> 10:24.120
they're kept at the sect to do spiritual cons

192
10:24.120 --> 10:24.980
and hard labor.

193
10:25.360 --> 10:26.480
That's why I said

194
10:26.840 --> 10:28.440
I've had so many chances

195
10:29.820 --> 10:31.420
to leave the Tianxiang Sect,

196
10:31.460 --> 10:32.590
but I could never go.

197
10:33.000 --> 10:34.730
But even if you stay in the sect,

198
10:34.870 --> 10:36.930
you can only protect them for a while.

199
10:37.030 --> 10:38.830
The Tianxiang Sect is a wolf den.

200
10:40.120 --> 10:42.480
Whoever takes it over will do the same thing.

201
10:42.480 --> 10:43.200
Yeah.

202
10:44.120 --> 10:45.650
If you kill the Sect Master,

203
10:46.120 --> 10:47.520
you'll get your revenge.

204
10:48.120 --> 10:49.720
But once the old Sect Master steps down,

205
10:49.720 --> 10:51.320
a new one will take his place.

206
10:52.390 --> 10:53.550
It won't make

207
10:54.510 --> 10:55.710
any difference to us.

208
10:56.240 --> 10:57.700
I think the same way you do.

209
10:57.750 --> 10:59.750
Killing the Sect Master is not hard,

210
11:00.140 --> 11:01.800
but it won't change the world.

211
11:02.290 --> 11:03.550
What I really want to do

212
11:04.440 --> 11:06.600
is expose the truth about the Tianxiang Sect.

213
11:06.600 --> 11:07.840
I want the world to see

214
11:08.060 --> 11:10.030
their deceiving witchcraft,

215
11:10.730 --> 11:11.610
and to see

216
11:11.660 --> 11:14.060
the living hell they've created for people

217
11:14.320 --> 11:15.850
like me and those children.

218
11:16.240 --> 11:18.840
I don't just want to bring the Sect Master down.

219
11:18.960 --> 11:20.960
I want to wipe out the Tianxiang Sect

220
11:22.230 --> 11:23.350
root and branch.

221
11:36.590 --> 11:39.120
You seem like you have something on your mind.

222
11:39.270 --> 11:40.720
Just say it.

223
11:41.790 --> 11:42.320
Master.

224
11:43.600 --> 11:44.510
You once said

225
11:44.840 --> 11:48.300
that when running a scam, you have to use their desires as bait.

226
11:48.840 --> 11:50.870
But the bait Shangguan Chengming is offering you now

227
11:50.870 --> 11:52.130
is right up your alley.

228
11:52.320 --> 11:53.680
My alley?

229
11:55.150 --> 11:56.030
I think

230
11:56.560 --> 11:58.820
he's been running a scam on you all along.

231
12:01.750 --> 12:02.880
Running a scam on me?

232
12:04.490 --> 12:05.850
Get me some water.

233
12:08.910 --> 12:09.870
Look at it.

234
12:23.710 --> 12:24.550
Sect Master.

235
12:25.130 --> 12:26.260
You wanted to see me?

236
12:26.640 --> 12:27.950
Have some tea with me.

237
12:28.960 --> 12:29.480
Sit.

238
12:33.900 --> 12:35.630
Why are you sitting here today?

239
12:37.510 --> 12:38.600
It's cool out here.

240
12:42.010 --> 12:43.650
Have you tried this?

241
12:44.290 --> 12:44.900
Try it.

242
12:45.680 --> 12:46.800
Hechuan pastry?

243
12:48.200 --> 12:49.150
Your mother

244
12:49.170 --> 12:50.760
loved these back in the day.

245
12:54.520 --> 12:55.980
I don't need you to tell me.

246
13:00.080 --> 13:01.030
Look at that.

247
13:03.910 --> 13:06.110
A few days ago, someone sent me a coffin,

248
13:06.360 --> 13:08.040
saying that the one lying inside

249
13:08.040 --> 13:09.440
is Shangguan Chengming.

250
13:14.570 --> 13:15.660
Want to open it?

251
13:18.720 --> 13:20.780
You've already seen it, haven't you?

252
13:22.460 --> 13:23.550
I want to see it too.

253
13:27.390 --> 13:28.920
There's a skeleton inside.

254
13:30.000 --> 13:31.200
To be honest with you,

255
13:31.260 --> 13:33.590
it was Zhang Dancheng who had it sent here.

256
13:33.720 --> 13:34.380
Obviously,

257
13:35.360 --> 13:36.480
he wants me to know

258
13:36.980 --> 13:39.110
that you're not Shangguan Chengming,

259
13:39.360 --> 13:40.840
then to use me to kill you.

260
13:41.130 --> 13:44.790
That way, he gets to watch a father and son turn against each other.

261
13:48.550 --> 13:49.280
Sixth Batou.

262
13:49.480 --> 13:50.030
Master.

263
13:50.150 --> 13:51.000
Have some men

264
13:51.550 --> 13:53.960
carry this coffin to the middle of the courtyard.

265
13:53.960 --> 13:55.030
Find me a torch.

266
13:55.790 --> 13:57.440
I'll burn it myself.

267
13:57.840 --> 13:58.320
Okay.

268
14:01.120 --> 14:02.720
I just want you to understand

269
14:03.000 --> 14:04.200
who the real bad guy is

270
14:05.280 --> 14:07.010
between me and Zhang Dancheng.

271
14:15.680 --> 14:17.170
Good job.

272
14:18.720 --> 14:19.450
Sixth Batou,

273
14:20.020 --> 14:21.380
take Chengming

274
14:21.780 --> 14:23.780
and call Zhang Dancheng over later.

275
14:24.050 --> 14:27.030
It's been a while since the two of us old friends have seen each other.

276
14:27.030 --> 14:28.030
Once you find him,

277
14:28.750 --> 14:30.030
you'll know the truth

278
14:31.150 --> 14:32.390
for yourself.

279
14:46.120 --> 14:46.960
Come on, bro.

280
14:47.160 --> 14:47.960
To a happy day!

281
14:53.480 --> 14:54.240
Liang.

282
14:54.720 --> 14:56.360
You're so generous.

283
14:57.520 --> 14:58.520
Well...

284
14:58.630 --> 15:00.990
Our Sixth Master has a beef with your brother,

285
15:00.990 --> 15:02.780
yet you're still willing to drink with me.

286
15:02.780 --> 15:03.910
You're a good buddy.

287
15:04.360 --> 15:06.270
If you hadn't put out all this meat today,

288
15:06.270 --> 15:07.470
who'd drink with you?

289
15:07.910 --> 15:10.370
I'm probably saying something I shouldn't,

290
15:10.910 --> 15:11.750
but I think

291
15:12.270 --> 15:14.790
Sixth Master isn't being fair.

292
15:15.180 --> 15:16.660
We're all in the same sect.

293
15:16.690 --> 15:19.180
Why does he have to keep giving Chengming a hard time?

294
15:19.180 --> 15:20.920
You and I both work for the people above us.

295
15:20.920 --> 15:22.360
If they give us an order,

296
15:22.560 --> 15:23.840
don't we have to follow it?

297
15:23.840 --> 15:25.630
When have we ever dared say no?

298
15:26.030 --> 15:26.720
Exactly.

299
15:27.440 --> 15:28.170
If you ask me,

300
15:28.430 --> 15:29.860
let's forget about

301
15:29.880 --> 15:31.240
their grudges today.

302
15:31.270 --> 15:34.100
Let's just enjoy ourselves!

303
15:34.120 --> 15:34.580
Come on!

304
15:34.580 --> 15:35.620
Come on, bro!

305
15:39.270 --> 15:39.870
Pour it.

306
15:40.200 --> 15:40.670
Come on.

307
15:41.080 --> 15:41.550
Cheers!

308
15:45.030 --> 15:46.030
Let me do it.

309
15:48.320 --> 15:49.000
Bro!

310
15:49.000 --> 15:49.360
Here!

311
15:56.630 --> 15:58.840
You can really drink, Liang.

312
15:59.840 --> 16:00.870
I still think

313
16:01.680 --> 16:04.930
my brother Chengming is getting a raw deal.

314
16:05.200 --> 16:05.840
Yes.

315
16:07.000 --> 16:07.930
Sixth Master...

316
16:09.510 --> 16:11.120
isn't being very fair.

317
16:11.160 --> 16:11.670
Yeah.

318
16:11.700 --> 16:12.650
I think you're right.

319
16:12.650 --> 16:13.610
And how so?

320
16:15.000 --> 16:15.600
Yes.

321
16:23.600 --> 16:24.690
Liang?

322
16:24.730 --> 16:25.890
What are you doing?

323
16:26.010 --> 16:28.140
We haven't finished drinking, Liang.

324
16:28.380 --> 16:29.020
Liang!

325
16:31.000 --> 16:31.630
Liang?

326
16:32.390 --> 16:33.150
Liang?

327
16:45.000 --> 16:46.520
Tie him up tight.

328
16:46.550 --> 16:49.120
Stay here and keep watch until I get back tonight.

329
16:49.120 --> 16:49.790
Yes!

330
16:59.750 --> 17:02.210
This place is actually pretty comfortable.

331
17:28.270 --> 17:29.270
Sixth Batou?

332
17:29.350 --> 17:31.740
Master Zhang, long time no see.

333
17:32.210 --> 17:34.300
You think just because Shangguan

334
17:34.330 --> 17:36.190
didn't tell us, we can't find you?

335
17:38.440 --> 17:39.490
Mentor,

336
17:40.370 --> 17:42.700
the Sect Master sent me to invite you back.

337
17:46.350 --> 17:47.200
Sure.

338
17:48.500 --> 17:50.500
Let me finish this one last scam.

339
17:50.520 --> 17:52.250
That's not necessary, Master.

340
17:52.390 --> 17:54.790
We run scams to make money.

341
17:55.080 --> 17:56.590
Right now, you might be able

342
17:56.590 --> 17:57.880
to make money,

343
17:58.350 --> 17:59.880
but you won't live to the day to spend it.

344
17:59.880 --> 18:00.550
Is that so?

345
18:02.750 --> 18:04.400
If I can make money,

346
18:05.070 --> 18:06.530
I can definitely spend it.

347
18:07.750 --> 18:10.160
I heard there's a new orphanage in town.

348
18:10.160 --> 18:12.640
I want to leave the children some money.

349
18:13.090 --> 18:14.240
Master, your skills

350
18:15.080 --> 18:16.320
are as sharp as ever.

351
18:17.000 --> 18:17.600
By the way,

352
18:17.920 --> 18:19.830
the old eunuch in the scam about Cao San

353
18:19.830 --> 18:21.720
was you, wasn't it?

354
18:23.620 --> 18:24.340
What?

355
18:25.030 --> 18:26.090
You want to kill me?

356
18:26.440 --> 18:27.070
Fine.

357
18:27.250 --> 18:28.640
Once I die,

358
18:28.790 --> 18:29.880
it won't be long

359
18:30.070 --> 18:31.920
before Cao San figures it out.

360
18:37.840 --> 18:38.710
Let's go.

361
18:39.070 --> 18:40.000
Sixth Batou.

362
18:42.680 --> 18:44.480
This is the deposit for my scam.

363
18:45.560 --> 18:47.320
Ten gold bars in total.

364
18:47.690 --> 18:50.180
This will be the last scam I ever run.

365
18:50.350 --> 18:51.640
Once I finish it,

366
18:51.770 --> 18:53.500
I'll give you half of the money.

367
18:53.790 --> 18:54.450
After that,

368
18:55.000 --> 18:57.130
I'll go with you, along with the money.

369
18:57.350 --> 19:00.150
You can even collect a reward from the Sect Master.

370
19:00.590 --> 19:02.000
What do you say?

371
19:07.580 --> 19:09.170
What if I say no?

372
19:21.480 --> 19:22.270
Mr. Jin.

373
19:23.030 --> 19:23.830
Mr. Jin.

374
19:24.350 --> 19:25.070
Mr. Jin.

375
19:25.070 --> 19:26.270
I've got something good here.

376
19:26.270 --> 19:27.400
It's damn good.

377
19:30.560 --> 19:31.440
We've got company?

378
19:31.440 --> 19:32.200
How about I...

379
19:32.200 --> 19:33.310
No need.

380
19:33.310 --> 19:34.270
They're all friends.

381
19:34.270 --> 19:35.750
Come on, let me introduce everyone.

382
19:35.750 --> 19:38.110
This is Mr. Song, Song Yangqun.

383
19:39.000 --> 19:39.930
Nice to meet you.

384
19:40.440 --> 19:41.200
Nice to meet you.

385
19:41.200 --> 19:42.200
Here's the thing.

386
19:42.200 --> 19:43.660
I heard that Chairman Liu is a fan

387
19:43.660 --> 19:45.420
of Master Zheng's paintings.

388
19:45.550 --> 19:47.510
This painting, Bamboo in a Gentle Breeze,

389
19:47.510 --> 19:49.240
is an original by Master Zheng.

390
19:50.560 --> 19:51.460
I specifically...

391
19:51.460 --> 19:52.460
Prepare some tea.

392
19:52.630 --> 19:53.740
Don't be so polite.

393
19:54.030 --> 19:54.590
I know

394
19:54.720 --> 19:56.680
you're good friends with Chairman Liu,

395
19:56.680 --> 19:58.210
so I brought this over first

396
19:58.270 --> 20:00.310
to get your opinion.

397
20:02.790 --> 20:03.720
Careful.

398
20:05.350 --> 20:06.200
Well?

399
20:14.030 --> 20:14.750
Mr. Jin,

400
20:15.010 --> 20:17.540
is there something wrong with this painting?

401
20:18.180 --> 20:19.290
Mr. Zheng's bamboo

402
20:19.350 --> 20:22.000
should have thin stalks

403
20:22.040 --> 20:23.720
and full leaves,

404
20:24.070 --> 20:25.480
with contrasting shades.

405
20:25.480 --> 20:28.280
This painting looks like his work,

406
20:28.310 --> 20:31.510
but it lacks his boldness and spirit.

407
20:32.790 --> 20:33.920
It can't be fake.

408
20:34.550 --> 20:35.960
I paid a fortune for it.

409
20:36.240 --> 20:37.000
I bought it at an auction house.

410
20:37.000 --> 20:38.220
I even had someone authenticate it.

411
20:38.220 --> 20:39.860
I'll listen to your explanation,

412
20:39.860 --> 20:41.120
but will Chairman Liu?

413
20:41.200 --> 20:42.110
Don't tell him you saw me.

414
20:42.110 --> 20:43.110
This way, please.

415
20:44.400 --> 20:45.640
Come on, Mr. Jin.

416
20:45.880 --> 20:46.680
Please don't.

417
20:46.680 --> 20:47.750
You have to help me.

418
20:47.830 --> 20:50.430
Otherwise, I'm stuck with this fake painting.

419
20:50.480 --> 20:51.350
Mr. Jin,

420
20:51.510 --> 20:52.590
please do me a favor.

421
20:52.590 --> 20:54.830
Could you come with me to the auction house

422
20:54.830 --> 20:56.270
and help clear up this whole fake-painting mess?

423
20:56.270 --> 20:57.070
Mentor,

424
20:57.340 --> 20:59.010
since Mr. Song is so sincere,

425
20:59.750 --> 21:01.230
why don't you help him out?

426
21:01.350 --> 21:02.350
Exactly, Mr. Jin.

427
21:02.370 --> 21:03.320
Well, you see...

428
21:05.110 --> 21:06.770
Please, you've got to help me.

429
21:10.000 --> 21:10.890
How about this?

430
21:11.440 --> 21:12.570
You can be the driver

431
21:12.850 --> 21:13.960
and send us there.

432
21:16.040 --> 21:16.570
Sure.

433
21:17.240 --> 21:17.720
Mr. Jin,

434
21:17.820 --> 21:18.340
please.

435
21:20.310 --> 21:20.970
Shangguan.

436
21:22.370 --> 21:24.680
Silly Liang is still in our hands.

437
21:27.030 --> 21:28.000
Just so you know.

438
21:30.200 --> 21:31.530
If you're that worried,

439
21:31.840 --> 21:32.990
let's go together.

440
21:41.720 --> 21:42.650
Later,

441
21:42.900 --> 21:43.730
play it by ear.

442
21:44.790 --> 21:46.000
If they try to stall,

443
21:46.550 --> 21:47.950
we'll fall out with them.

444
21:48.530 --> 21:51.180
Worst comes to worst, we'll take Song out too.

445
21:51.200 --> 21:52.840
Master, I think

446
21:53.440 --> 21:55.720
we should let them finish the scam.

447
21:58.070 --> 21:59.920
Delays may lead to complications.

448
21:59.920 --> 22:01.450
Why are you being so greedy?

449
22:01.480 --> 22:01.960
Master,

450
22:02.000 --> 22:03.590
we've already got Shangguan Chengming

451
22:03.590 --> 22:05.050
firmly under our control.

452
22:05.170 --> 22:06.310
What is there to worry about?

453
22:06.310 --> 22:07.750
We have Silly Liang in our hands.

454
22:07.750 --> 22:08.790
And there's Fifth Batou.

455
22:08.790 --> 22:10.590
You and I can't lock her up,

456
22:10.680 --> 22:13.000
but the Sect Master is keeping an eye on Zhang Dancheng.

457
22:13.000 --> 22:15.350
In other words, Fifth Batou is a hostage as well.

458
22:15.350 --> 22:17.270
We can't keep the Sect Master waiting that long.

459
22:17.270 --> 22:17.830
One day.

460
22:18.550 --> 22:20.080
Let's just give him one day.

461
22:20.400 --> 22:22.160
And think about it.

462
22:22.160 --> 22:23.440
If we really take

463
22:23.440 --> 22:25.510
Zhang Dancheng and Shangguan Chengming

464
22:25.510 --> 22:26.790
back now,

465
22:26.960 --> 22:28.720
the Sect Master will kill Zhang Dancheng

466
22:28.720 --> 22:30.960
and officially acknowledge Shangguan Chengming as his son.

467
22:30.960 --> 22:32.430
Will you still have a chance then?

468
22:32.430 --> 22:34.160
Why do you think the Sect Master

469
22:34.270 --> 22:36.800
likes that brat Shangguan Chengming so much?

470
22:37.000 --> 22:39.400
Because he always manages to surprise him.

471
22:39.720 --> 22:41.320
Let's just keep an eye on him,

472
22:41.510 --> 22:42.680
let him finish the scam,

473
22:42.680 --> 22:44.440
then bring back both of them and the money.

474
22:44.440 --> 22:46.960
Then we can also give the Sect Master a surprise.

475
22:46.960 --> 22:47.640
What if

476
22:48.110 --> 22:50.770
we wait until Zhang Dancheng finishes the scam,

477
22:51.240 --> 22:52.680
then kill them both?

478
22:59.440 --> 23:00.960
When we report back,

479
23:01.640 --> 23:02.550
we'll say

480
23:03.830 --> 23:06.550
the two of them turned against each other

481
23:07.720 --> 23:09.050
and killed one another.

482
23:14.830 --> 23:15.480
Mr. Jin,

483
23:15.680 --> 23:16.510
we're here.

484
23:17.270 --> 23:19.730
This is the auction house where I bought the fake painting.

485
23:19.730 --> 23:20.550
You must find a way

486
23:20.010 --> 23:24.910
[Dongyu Chenggu Auction House]

487
23:20.550 --> 23:22.680
to get me the real one.

488
23:23.790 --> 23:25.070
Ladies and gentlemen,

489
23:25.270 --> 23:26.510
distinguished guests,

490
23:26.510 --> 23:29.000
welcome to this grand auction!

491
23:31.960 --> 23:33.400
I'm your host today,

492
23:33.440 --> 23:35.880
and it's my great honor to bring you

493
23:35.880 --> 23:37.880
this spectacular auction.

494
23:38.200 --> 23:38.730
Alright,

495
23:39.030 --> 23:41.720
let's begin with our first lot.

496
23:41.920 --> 23:44.240
This is a Chenghui Hundred Flowers Vase

497
23:44.350 --> 23:45.720
from the Qianlong era.

498
23:46.000 --> 23:46.860
The opening bid

499
23:47.550 --> 23:48.550
is 100 fabi.

500
23:49.200 --> 23:49.790
100 fabi!

501
23:49.790 --> 23:51.680
Okay, now it's 100 fabi.

502
23:51.790 --> 23:53.110
Any higher bid?

503
23:53.310 --> 23:53.960
200 fabi!

504
23:53.960 --> 23:54.960
Alright, 200.

505
23:56.000 --> 23:57.070
Tell me,

506
23:57.070 --> 23:57.880
how does an auction house

507
23:57.880 --> 23:59.270
run scams on the rich?

508
24:01.030 --> 24:02.680
It's like a restaurant serving fish.

509
24:02.680 --> 24:04.350
When they show the fish to you, it's alive.

510
24:04.350 --> 24:05.550
Once it goes into the kitchen,

511
24:05.550 --> 24:06.750
they swap it out for a dead one.

512
24:06.750 --> 24:08.070
You have to figure out

513
24:08.240 --> 24:10.700
how they switch out the real pieces for fakes

514
24:10.750 --> 24:12.810
before you know how to make your move.

515
24:12.880 --> 24:14.240
Three hundred, going three times!

516
24:14.240 --> 24:15.500
Sold to the gentleman!

517
24:20.310 --> 24:21.390
Alright, everyone.

518
24:21.390 --> 24:23.100
They'll bring the real piece in

519
24:23.100 --> 24:24.500
through that door later.

520
24:24.880 --> 24:26.480
There's a hallway behind it.

521
24:26.790 --> 24:28.070
At the end of the hallway

522
24:28.070 --> 24:30.030
is a room called the Treasure Vault.

523
24:30.030 --> 24:30.830
Open the door.

524
24:31.390 --> 24:33.920
Only a special key carried by one of the guards

525
24:33.960 --> 24:35.440
can open the door.

526
24:36.540 --> 24:38.400
Every item here has two versions:

527
24:38.720 --> 24:39.480
one genuine

528
24:39.700 --> 24:40.540
and one fake.

529
24:41.400 --> 24:43.270
All the genuine pieces that are sold at auction

530
24:43.270 --> 24:44.670
will be put into storage.

531
24:45.880 --> 24:47.070
But be careful.

532
24:47.810 --> 24:50.130
All the guards here are armed.

533
24:53.110 --> 24:54.110
Alright, everyone.

534
24:54.110 --> 24:56.750
Next up is a painting by Master Zheng.

535
24:56.750 --> 24:57.610
The opening bid

536
24:57.790 --> 24:58.750
is 200 francs.

537
24:59.240 --> 25:01.310
Anyone bid 200?

538
25:03.640 --> 25:05.830
Will it go unsold if nobody bids?

539
25:06.480 --> 25:07.680
Wait a little longer.

540
25:11.550 --> 25:12.110
200!

541
25:12.110 --> 25:13.110
Alright, 200!

542
25:13.110 --> 25:14.110
We have 200.

543
25:14.110 --> 25:15.480
Anyone want to go higher?

544
25:15.480 --> 25:16.160
300!

545
25:16.160 --> 25:17.440
Alright, 300!

546
25:17.750 --> 25:20.030
The buyer is called Paozi.

547
25:20.030 --> 25:22.030
The moment Paozi bids,

548
25:22.440 --> 25:24.300
the shill will drive up the price.

549
25:25.160 --> 25:25.590
400!

550
25:25.590 --> 25:26.480
400!

551
25:26.480 --> 25:27.510
Now it's 400!

552
25:27.510 --> 25:28.480
500 fabi!

553
25:28.550 --> 25:29.440
500!

554
25:29.440 --> 25:30.400
Now it's 500!

555
25:30.400 --> 25:31.330
We're at 500 now.

556
25:31.480 --> 25:33.880
Aren't they afraid no one will bid higher than them?

557
25:33.880 --> 25:36.030
It's the same with fortune-telling.

558
25:36.400 --> 25:38.030
Before every auction, there would be someone

559
25:38.030 --> 25:41.640
approaching the Paozis and striking up a conversation.

560
25:41.640 --> 25:43.590
They already know the highest price

561
25:43.590 --> 25:45.350
each Paozi is willing to pay.

562
25:45.550 --> 25:47.010
Five hundred, going once!

563
25:47.270 --> 25:48.750
Five hundred, going twice!

564
25:48.750 --> 25:49.030
Five hundred...

565
25:49.030 --> 25:49.590
Six hundred!

566
25:49.590 --> 25:50.440
Six hundred!

567
25:51.070 --> 25:52.350
We're at 600!

568
25:52.720 --> 25:54.270
Any higher bids?

569
25:55.350 --> 25:55.880
Alright.

570
25:56.160 --> 25:57.560
Six hundred, going once!

571
25:57.720 --> 25:59.160
Six hundred, going twice!

572
25:59.160 --> 26:00.640
Six hundred, going three times!

573
26:00.640 --> 26:01.270
Congratulations!

574
26:01.270 --> 26:02.640
Sold to the gentleman!

575
26:21.000 --> 26:21.920
What's wrong with you?

576
26:21.920 --> 26:23.030
Watch where you're going!

577
26:23.030 --> 26:25.350
Can you afford to pay for this if you break it?

578
26:25.350 --> 26:25.960
Hurry up!

579
26:26.310 --> 26:26.790
I'm sorry.

580
26:26.790 --> 26:27.720
What happened?

581
26:28.830 --> 26:30.380
We just bumped into each other.

582
26:30.380 --> 26:31.290
Go ahead.

583
26:37.110 --> 26:38.640
I've never seen you before.

584
26:39.070 --> 26:39.750
New here?

585
26:44.070 --> 26:44.590
Stop!

586
26:48.110 --> 26:48.750
Sir,

587
26:49.110 --> 26:49.970
your painting.

588
26:53.310 --> 26:53.910
Thank you.

589
26:57.160 --> 26:58.160
Congratulations, sir.

590
26:58.160 --> 26:58.720
Congratulations.

591
26:58.720 --> 26:59.350
What is it?

592
26:59.350 --> 27:00.160
Nothing.

593
27:00.160 --> 27:02.400
We're admirers of Master Zheng.

594
27:03.100 --> 27:05.790
Would you do us the honor of letting us have a look?

595
27:05.790 --> 27:07.480
You were the ones bidding against me

596
27:07.480 --> 27:09.030
at the auction just now, weren't you?

597
27:09.030 --> 27:09.830
Impossible.

598
27:09.830 --> 27:10.640
Definitely not.

599
27:10.640 --> 27:12.830
We would never take something someone else loves.

600
27:12.830 --> 27:13.440
Yes.

601
27:13.440 --> 27:15.350
We just want to have a look.

602
27:15.510 --> 27:15.970
Really?

603
27:16.200 --> 27:16.590
Yes.

604
27:16.590 --> 27:17.070
Really.

605
27:19.330 --> 27:19.960
Fine.

606
27:20.400 --> 27:22.450
Let me show you!

607
27:22.480 --> 27:24.070
Thank you.

608
27:24.510 --> 27:25.350
It's an honor.

609
27:30.880 --> 27:32.110
What a beautiful painting.

610
27:32.110 --> 27:33.270
And look at the calligraphy.

611
27:33.270 --> 27:35.240
What beautiful bamboo.

612
27:35.240 --> 27:35.960
Never seen anything like it, have you?

613
27:35.960 --> 27:36.590
No, no.

614
27:36.590 --> 27:37.200
Never.

615
27:37.200 --> 27:39.200
I saw it with my own eyes just now.

616
27:39.270 --> 27:41.640
This is definitely an original by Zheng Banqiao.

617
27:41.640 --> 27:42.350
Yes.

618
27:42.400 --> 27:43.600
Guaranteed genuine!

619
27:43.790 --> 27:44.720
Yes, guaranteed genuine.

620
27:44.720 --> 27:45.880
So wonderful.

621
27:45.880 --> 27:46.750
Amazing.

622
27:46.750 --> 27:47.550
So beautiful.

623
27:50.640 --> 27:51.350
This is...

624
27:52.410 --> 27:53.890
Tianxiang?

625
27:54.820 --> 27:55.720
What does this mean?

626
27:55.720 --> 27:56.350
Well...

627
27:57.270 --> 27:58.310
Tianxiang?

628
28:00.030 --> 28:01.070
What does Tianxiang mean?

629
28:01.070 --> 28:01.830
I don't know.

630
28:02.200 --> 28:02.830
I don't know.

631
28:02.830 --> 28:03.830
What does it mean?

632
28:07.400 --> 28:08.240
What's wrong with you?

633
28:08.240 --> 28:09.590
Watch where you're going!

634
28:09.590 --> 28:10.830
Can you afford to pay for this if you break it?

635
28:10.830 --> 28:11.880
I'm sorry.

636
28:12.480 --> 28:13.080
It's fake!

637
28:13.510 --> 28:14.550
You liars!

638
28:14.550 --> 28:15.880
This is a fake painting!

639
28:16.020 --> 28:16.950
Look!

640
28:17.550 --> 28:19.480
You can tell it's a fake at a glance!

641
28:19.720 --> 28:21.110
I spent 600 fabi on it!

642
28:21.550 --> 28:23.070
Are you even human?

643
28:23.960 --> 28:24.750
Once it's sold, there's no backing out!

644
28:24.750 --> 28:25.350
What?

645
28:26.680 --> 28:27.920
Don't come over!

646
28:29.030 --> 28:29.750
Calm down!

647
28:29.920 --> 28:31.200
Calm down?

648
28:47.110 --> 28:47.920
Zhao!

649
28:48.160 --> 28:48.960
Zhao, bad news.

650
28:48.960 --> 28:49.790
Something happened at the auction.

651
28:49.790 --> 28:50.480
Something happened?

652
28:50.480 --> 28:50.880
Yes.

653
28:50.880 --> 28:51.960
Stay here.

654
28:51.960 --> 28:52.960
I'll come to you later!

655
28:52.960 --> 28:54.350
Keep an eye on him!

656
28:54.350 --> 28:56.010
The three of you, come with me!

657
29:26.560 --> 29:27.880
What do you mean by fake?

658
29:27.880 --> 29:29.550
We gave it to you,

659
29:30.160 --> 29:31.400
and you brought it back.

660
29:31.400 --> 29:32.800
We don't know if it's even

661
29:32.990 --> 29:33.850
the same thing.

662
29:34.000 --> 29:35.400
Are you trying to fool me?

663
29:35.920 --> 29:36.310
Here.

664
29:36.790 --> 29:37.790
Look what this is.

665
29:37.940 --> 29:40.100
Now you're turning around

666
29:40.130 --> 29:41.560
and accusing me?

667
29:41.830 --> 29:43.830
You'd better solve this today,

668
29:43.920 --> 29:46.160
or you'll all be going to jail.

669
29:50.030 --> 29:50.880
What do we do?

670
29:51.660 --> 29:53.720
How about we give him the real one?

671
29:54.240 --> 29:55.110
Weren't the fakes

672
29:55.110 --> 29:56.520
we've made before pretty convincing?

673
29:56.520 --> 29:57.580
Who knew there'd be

674
29:57.600 --> 29:59.330
an extra seal on this painting?

675
30:00.770 --> 30:01.290
It's...

676
30:04.280 --> 30:05.680
The painting is gone!

677
30:06.810 --> 30:07.890
The new guy!

678
30:21.890 --> 30:24.680
Did you get a good look at who did it?

679
30:25.030 --> 30:26.030
Mr. Lu,

680
30:26.160 --> 30:26.680
I...

681
30:27.200 --> 30:27.710
I...

682
30:33.720 --> 30:34.550
It's okay.

683
30:34.750 --> 30:36.400
Now that you've admitted your fault,

684
30:36.400 --> 30:38.200
do your job properly from now on.

685
30:38.310 --> 30:38.840
Thank...

686
30:38.960 --> 30:39.960
Thank you, Mr. Lu!

687
30:40.030 --> 30:41.070
Thank you, Mr. Lu!

688
30:43.400 --> 30:44.030
Open it.

689
30:44.050 --> 30:44.860
Excuse me.

690
30:46.260 --> 30:47.110
Are you done?

691
30:49.920 --> 30:50.880
Excuse me, sir.

692
30:51.680 --> 30:52.200
Sir.

693
30:52.940 --> 30:54.370
The auction is not over yet.

694
30:54.370 --> 30:56.520
Please don't rush to leave.

695
30:57.110 --> 30:57.920
What do you mean?

696
30:57.920 --> 30:58.920
Mr. Lu said

697
30:59.200 --> 31:00.100
everyone here today

698
31:00.100 --> 31:01.110
is our distinguished guest.

699
31:01.110 --> 31:03.170
He told us to take good care of you all.

700
31:04.160 --> 31:05.960
They may not be able to get out for now.

701
31:05.960 --> 31:08.020
Let's go back to the apartment first.

702
31:22.830 --> 31:23.310
Mr. Lu.

703
31:23.830 --> 31:25.690
We found this in the back hallway.

704
31:25.750 --> 31:27.410
It should belong to the thief.

705
31:37.510 --> 31:38.510
Who are you?

706
31:39.240 --> 31:39.880
Where is the painting?

707
31:39.880 --> 31:41.680
What are you talking about? We know nothing.

708
31:41.680 --> 31:42.140
Search!

709
31:42.440 --> 31:42.720
Yes!

710
31:42.830 --> 31:43.510
Yes!

711
31:46.680 --> 31:47.810
Behind the cabinet!

712
31:49.110 --> 31:50.370
Check under the chair!

713
31:52.480 --> 31:53.810
We found nothing, Boss!

714
31:54.030 --> 31:55.400
Nothing here either, Boss!

715
31:55.400 --> 31:56.260
Take them away!

716
31:57.200 --> 31:57.640
Move!

717
32:20.440 --> 32:21.240
That's right.

718
32:23.870 --> 32:26.130
We'll use this painting to trade for him.

719
32:26.590 --> 32:27.070
Who?

720
32:28.480 --> 32:29.740
Shangguan Chengming?

721
32:30.960 --> 32:32.750
You and the painting are both here, right?

722
32:32.750 --> 32:34.010
If Lu Qinhai kills him,

723
32:34.880 --> 32:37.680
wouldn't that be killing two birds with one stone?

724
32:38.040 --> 32:39.200
Let's go, Master.

725
32:48.000 --> 32:48.680
What?

726
32:49.920 --> 32:53.350
If anything happens to Chengming,

727
32:54.160 --> 32:56.690
how are you going to answer to the Sect Master?

728
33:04.030 --> 33:05.230
What are you doing?

729
33:06.790 --> 33:07.850
What are you doing?

730
33:08.960 --> 33:09.640
Help!

731
33:10.270 --> 33:11.510
Help!

732
33:12.590 --> 33:13.880
Let me go!

733
33:14.960 --> 33:16.070
Let me go!

734
33:16.660 --> 33:18.020
Let me go!

735
33:19.750 --> 33:21.160
Let me go!

736
33:23.680 --> 33:24.830
Everyone outside

737
33:25.000 --> 33:25.930
is talking about

738
33:26.400 --> 33:27.310
a new culture

739
33:27.660 --> 33:28.790
and a new way of life,

740
33:29.520 --> 33:30.920
but I stick to the old ways

741
33:31.070 --> 33:32.430
and these old things.

742
33:33.070 --> 33:34.440
Confucius said,

743
33:34.550 --> 33:36.680
"Restrain yourself and return to propriety. That is benevolence."

744
33:36.680 --> 33:38.130
You know what that means?

745
33:39.090 --> 33:41.290
Don't look at what you shouldn't.

746
33:42.270 --> 33:44.270
Don't listen to what you shouldn't.

747
33:44.590 --> 33:46.110
And don't take

748
33:46.880 --> 33:48.310
what isn't yours.

749
33:49.350 --> 33:50.640
Back then,

750
33:51.120 --> 33:53.050
because I didn't understand that,

751
33:53.180 --> 33:55.150
I took something I shouldn't have

752
33:56.530 --> 33:57.780
and lost a hand for it.

753
34:00.240 --> 34:01.610
I'll only ask you once.

754
34:03.880 --> 34:05.110
Where's the painting?

755
34:05.110 --> 34:06.200
I sold it a long time ago.

756
34:06.200 --> 34:07.400
Who did you sell it to?

757
34:07.400 --> 34:08.280
Mr. Song.

758
34:08.400 --> 34:09.960
He said you tricked him with a fake,

759
34:09.960 --> 34:11.030
so he hired us

760
34:11.480 --> 34:13.940
to steal an original by Master Zheng for him.

761
34:15.000 --> 34:16.920
That bastard Song.

762
34:17.699 --> 34:19.030
He's quite the schemer.

763
34:24.750 --> 34:26.870
You stole the painting

764
34:27.440 --> 34:28.840
right under my nose.

765
34:29.670 --> 34:32.659
Even if I can let go of the painting,

766
34:35.550 --> 34:36.840
I still need...

767
34:37.969 --> 34:39.010
to save face.

768
34:41.000 --> 34:41.800
Mr. Lu!

769
34:46.870 --> 34:47.679
Bring him in.

770
34:47.710 --> 34:48.350
Yes.

771
35:10.000 --> 35:10.730
The painting

772
35:11.540 --> 35:12.310
is real.

773
35:12.670 --> 35:13.970
I've given you the painting.

774
35:13.970 --> 35:14.900
Let him go.

775
35:15.050 --> 35:16.650
Sixth Master, I'm here!

776
35:16.880 --> 35:17.800
Sixth Master!

777
35:18.710 --> 35:19.760
Sixth Master!

778
35:22.070 --> 35:23.530
It's only right for a thief

779
35:23.680 --> 35:25.070
to return stolen goods.

780
35:25.320 --> 35:26.480
Keeping him here

781
35:27.550 --> 35:28.360
is even more

782
35:28.390 --> 35:31.470
justified.

783
35:32.070 --> 35:33.600
For such a big auction house

784
35:34.230 --> 35:35.980
to resort to such dirty tricks—

785
35:36.000 --> 35:37.260
is that only right too?

786
35:37.320 --> 35:38.850
What are you talking about?

787
35:38.850 --> 35:40.650
You run auctions on the surface,

788
35:40.880 --> 35:42.000
but behind the scenes,

789
35:42.000 --> 35:43.760
you swap genuine pieces for fakes.

790
35:43.760 --> 35:44.920
Your treasures

791
35:44.940 --> 35:47.190
never make it into the hands of ordinary people.

792
35:47.190 --> 35:48.000
Tell me,

793
35:49.550 --> 35:51.150
if some government official

794
35:51.840 --> 35:54.700
finds out you've been pulling these tricks on them,

795
35:57.070 --> 35:58.730
do you think you can handle it?

796
36:06.960 --> 36:08.850
You don't

797
36:08.960 --> 36:11.440
look much like a thief.

798
36:11.630 --> 36:14.230
You don't look much like a businessman either.

799
36:23.070 --> 36:23.730
Detective,

800
36:24.030 --> 36:24.690
that's him.

801
36:24.820 --> 36:25.820
He sold me a fake.

802
36:25.880 --> 36:27.150
I have the evidence right here!

803
36:27.150 --> 36:27.880
Nonsense!

804
36:28.070 --> 36:29.710
You sent people here to steal from me.

805
36:29.710 --> 36:31.280
We have both witnesses and evidence right here!

806
36:31.280 --> 36:31.770
Detective,

807
36:31.770 --> 36:32.830
don't believe him.

808
36:33.030 --> 36:34.110
Look at my face.

809
36:34.210 --> 36:35.330
They did this to me.

810
36:36.380 --> 36:36.970
Look!

811
36:37.320 --> 36:38.840
They're even using torture on him!

812
36:38.840 --> 36:39.550
Detective,

813
36:39.760 --> 36:41.320
he's just making false accusations against me!

814
36:41.320 --> 36:41.980
Detective.

815
36:42.230 --> 36:43.290
Alright, alright.

816
36:43.610 --> 36:44.850
I'll take both the witnesses

817
36:44.850 --> 36:47.510
and the items back and investigate thoroughly.

818
36:48.670 --> 36:49.330
Detective,

819
36:49.880 --> 36:52.320
Director Wang's stuff is also here.

820
36:52.840 --> 36:54.500
You can leave my things alone,

821
36:54.630 --> 36:55.800
can't you?

822
36:55.970 --> 36:56.900
Cut the crap.

823
36:58.240 --> 37:00.070
They're all evidence.

824
37:01.590 --> 37:02.590
Take them away!

825
37:03.630 --> 37:04.800
Let me go!

826
37:05.960 --> 37:07.670
Sixth Master, I'm here!

827
37:07.700 --> 37:08.660
Sixth Master!

828
37:19.050 --> 37:20.400
Thank Detective Guo for me.

829
37:20.400 --> 37:21.240
See you.

830
37:35.630 --> 37:36.360
Detective,

831
37:36.920 --> 37:39.000
Lu Qinhai's men have confessed.

832
37:39.070 --> 37:39.960
Well?

833
37:40.190 --> 37:40.920
This Lu guy

834
37:40.920 --> 37:42.800
used to specialize in arranging contract killings.

835
37:42.800 --> 37:44.320
He built his business on more than a dozen lives.

836
37:44.320 --> 37:45.230
As long as he was paid,

837
37:45.230 --> 37:46.670
he would kill anyone. Including a woman in her 60s.

838
37:46.670 --> 37:47.630
Bastard.

839
37:47.800 --> 37:49.260
He's worse than an animal!

840
37:50.030 --> 37:50.920
Don't be angry.

841
37:51.320 --> 37:53.980
Detective Guo, you made another contribution.

842
37:54.960 --> 37:56.510
Sixth Master, please wait for a minute.

843
37:56.510 --> 37:58.440
I'll bring your man to you shortly.

844
37:58.920 --> 37:59.520
Thank you.

845
38:19.840 --> 38:21.230
The woman in her 60s from the fishing village

846
38:21.230 --> 38:22.830
was also killed by Lu Qinhai?

847
38:23.150 --> 38:23.550
Yes.

848
38:24.150 --> 38:25.150
What was her name?

849
38:26.480 --> 38:27.410
I think it was...

850
38:28.960 --> 38:29.840
Wang Guifen.

851
38:30.360 --> 38:31.420
Why did he kill her?

852
38:32.420 --> 38:34.460
Someone paid him to kill her.

853
38:34.920 --> 38:35.980
How did he kill her?

854
38:36.590 --> 38:39.790
The person who paid him said there couldn't be any wounds.

855
38:39.880 --> 38:42.340
So he suffocated the old woman with a pillow.

856
39:06.270 --> 39:07.780
[Interrogation Room]

857
39:13.560 --> 39:15.080
Someone bailed you out.

858
39:15.250 --> 39:16.370
You can go now.

859
39:23.190 --> 39:24.070
Detective,

860
39:25.110 --> 39:26.880
about my evidence...

861
39:27.070 --> 39:28.190
What evidence?

862
39:28.360 --> 39:29.690
Those are stolen goods!

863
39:30.920 --> 39:32.380
Do you want to leave or not?

864
39:34.070 --> 39:34.550
Yes.

865
39:34.960 --> 39:35.510
Yes.

866
39:58.950 --> 40:00.680
Master Swindler took the bait.

867
40:01.360 --> 40:02.710
I saw him

868
40:02.730 --> 40:04.770
take Fan Yifei and Lu Qinhai away.

869
40:05.400 --> 40:07.590
Lu Qinhai has some powerful connections.

870
40:07.590 --> 40:09.790
Most people wouldn't dare go after him.

871
40:09.880 --> 40:10.670
Luckily,

872
40:10.920 --> 40:12.300
Detective Guo cooperated.

873
40:12.300 --> 40:14.100
You can fool people, but not Heaven.

874
40:14.100 --> 40:15.760
Good and evil will always have their consequences.

875
40:15.760 --> 40:17.390
The scam we set up for Master Swindler

876
40:17.390 --> 40:19.430
has finally come full circle.

877
40:19.450 --> 40:21.150
Now that we've helped Master Swindler

878
40:21.150 --> 40:22.670
find his real enemy,

879
40:22.920 --> 40:23.650
it's time...

880
40:25.340 --> 40:27.010
for him to help me.

881
40:30.480 --> 40:31.360
Good wine!

882
40:31.950 --> 40:32.950
Good wine!

883
40:40.880 --> 40:41.710
Good wine!

884
40:43.960 --> 40:44.590
Brother,

885
40:45.060 --> 40:46.390
didn't we

886
40:46.780 --> 40:48.130
already have a deal?

887
40:48.880 --> 40:50.880
Why did you bring me here for a drink?

888
40:51.510 --> 40:52.770
Remember Wang Guifen?

889
40:54.760 --> 40:55.690
I don't know her.

890
40:56.920 --> 40:58.050
Eighteen years ago.

891
40:59.030 --> 41:00.160
Li Fishing Village.

892
41:02.150 --> 41:03.010
I remember her.

893
41:03.190 --> 41:04.190
Did you kill her?

894
41:04.440 --> 41:05.230
I did.

895
41:09.630 --> 41:10.690
That was my mother.

896
41:16.600 --> 41:17.510
Who hired you?

897
41:20.230 --> 41:21.160
The Sect Master.

898
41:23.510 --> 41:24.760
Tell me the truth!

899
41:25.660 --> 41:27.590
The Sect Master of the Tianxiang Sect!

900
41:27.590 --> 41:28.870
He paid me!

901
42:05.720 --> 42:07.390
Whoever paid me,

902
42:08.370 --> 42:10.370
I did the job for them!

903
42:47.520 --> 42:49.790
[In the next episode]

904
42:50.630 --> 42:51.000
Master!

905
42:51.000 --> 42:51.480
Senior?

906
42:51.480 --> 42:51.880
Master!

907
42:51.880 --> 42:52.400
What's wrong?

908
42:52.400 --> 42:53.320
Master, what's wrong?

909
42:53.320 --> 42:54.450
The tea is poisoned.

910
42:54.630 --> 42:57.000
Take Shangguan Chengming away!

911
42:57.230 --> 42:58.000
Yes!

912
42:58.960 --> 42:59.710
Senior.

913
43:00.130 --> 43:01.790
The medicine is here, Senior.

914
43:02.150 --> 43:03.070
Senior?

915
43:03.510 --> 43:04.230
Senior!

916
43:07.430 --> 43:08.460
Senior,

917
43:08.830 --> 43:10.660
I will avenge you.

918
43:12.090 --> 43:13.430
I promise.
